<div class=Section1>

<p class=MsoTitle>SOCIAL EVENTS: PREPARATION AND CLEAN-UP CHECKLIST</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u>Assistance with set-up:</u></b></p>

<ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Take down/move the existing room configuration (i.e.
     table, chairs, blackboard, push back nursery items in fellowship hall)</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Set-up tables, chairs, tablecloths, paper products,
     decorations, drink table, garbage cans</li>
</ul>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u>Operation:<o:p></o:p></u></b></p>

<ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Arrange food items on table by grouping (i.e. main
     items, salads, desserts)</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Heat food, as necessary</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Use chafing dishes, as necessary</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Check and refill drink containers</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Check garbage cans, empty and re-bag</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Discard used cups, plates etc.</li>
</ul>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u>Clean-up:<o:p></o:p></u></b></p>

<ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Clean-up drink table – rinse out beverage containers
     and store in supply closet</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Clean-up food table – rinse and clean dishes; cover
     remaining food dishes with saran wrap</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Discard bagged garbage and take to dumpster; re-bag
     cans</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Vacuum carpets</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Return unused paper products to supply closet</li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'>Return room to previous configuration</li>
</ul>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

